  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Federal District Sanitation Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Saneamiento Distrito Federal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE OBJECTIVE OF THE PROGRAM IS TO IMPROVE POTABLE WATER AND SEWERAGE SERVICES, ALONG WITH STORM SEWERS AND DRAINAGE. THE PROGRAM SEEKS TO PROMOTE GREATER INSTITUTIONAL EFFICIENCY, FINANCIAL SUSTAINABILITY AND PRIVATE SECTOR PARTICIPATION IN MANAGEMENT AND INVESTMENT FINANCING. THE PROGRAM WILL ALSO FINANCE WORKS THAT ARE CONSIDERED TO BE URGENTLY NEEDED WITHIN THE SECTORS MENTIONED ABOVE.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
